{"seq":4,"slug":"publishing-workflow","title":"发布工作流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/shared-packages/publishing-workflow","wordCount":824,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"发布工作流\">发布工作流</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Monorepo 发布要处理&quot;多包 + 包间依赖&quot;带来的连锁更新，其核心是三个概念：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>发布工作流</td>\n<td>版本更新 → 构建 → 发布 → 打 tag 的自动化</td>\n<td>处理多包间的依赖同步</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>prepublishOnly</code></td>\n<td><code>npm publish</code> 前自动触发的脚本</td>\n<td>发布前构建的安全网</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>npm Provenance</td>\n<td>将包与 CI 构建关联的来源证明</td>\n<td>供应链安全可追溯</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键难点在于<strong>内部依赖的字符串替换</strong>：当 <code>utils</code> 版本更新，引用它的 <code>ui</code> 的 <code>workspace:*</code> 声明需同步转为实际版本号，<code>changeset version</code> 会自动完成这一步。此外，发布前的验证链条（typecheck → test → lint → publint → arethetypeswrong）与发布时的签名证明共同构成质量与安全的两道防线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"monorepo-发布的复杂性\">Monorepo 发布的复杂性</h2><p>在 Polyrepo 中发布一个包很简单：更新版本号、构建、发布。但在 Monorepo 中，一次发布可能涉及多个包，且这些包之间有依赖关系——<code>@myorg/ui</code> 依赖 <code>@myorg/utils</code>，如果 <code>utils</code> 更新了版本，<code>ui</code> 的依赖声明也需要同步更新。<strong>发布工作流</strong>（Publishing Workflow）就是自动化处理这些复杂关系的流程。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    DEV[开发阶段] --&gt;|创建 changeset| CS[Changeset 文件]&#10;    CS --&gt;|合并到 main| VERSION[版本更新阶段]&#10;    VERSION --&gt; V1[更新 package.json 版本号]&#10;    VERSION --&gt; V2[更新内部依赖版本]&#10;    VERSION --&gt; V3[生成 CHANGELOG.md]&#10;    V1 &amp; V2 &amp; V3 --&gt; BUILD[构建所有待发布包]&#10;    BUILD --&gt; PUBLISH[发布到 npm]&#10;    PUBLISH --&gt; TAG[创建 Git tags]\">flowchart TD\n    DEV[开发阶段] --&gt;|创建 changeset| CS[Changeset 文件]\n    CS --&gt;|合并到 main| VERSION[版本更新阶段]\n    VERSION --&gt; V1[更新 package.json 版本号]\n    VERSION --&gt; V2[更新内部依赖版本]\n    VERSION --&gt; V3[生成 CHANGELOG.md]\n    V1 &amp; V2 &amp; V3 --&gt; BUILD[构建所有待发布包]\n    BUILD --&gt; PUBLISH[发布到 npm]\n    PUBLISH --&gt; TAG[创建 Git tags]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"changesets-publish-流程\">Changesets Publish 流程</h2><p>Changesets 提供了完整的版本更新和发布命令：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 步骤 1：消费 changeset 文件，更新版本号&#10;// pnpm changeset version&#10;&#10;// 步骤 2：构建所有需要发布的包&#10;// pnpm turbo run build --filter=...[HEAD~1]&#10;&#10;// 步骤 3：发布到 npm registry&#10;// pnpm changeset publish&#10;&#10;// 完整流程脚本&#10;// package.json&#10;{&#10;  &quot;scripts&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;version-packages&quot;: &quot;changeset version&quot;,&#10;    &quot;release&quot;: &quot;pnpm build &amp;&amp; changeset publish&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 步骤 1：消费 changeset 文件，更新版本号</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// pnpm changeset version</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 步骤 2：构建所有需要发布的包</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// pnpm turbo run build --filter=...[HEAD~1]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 步骤 3：发布到 npm registry</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// pnpm changeset publish</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 完整流程脚本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// package.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  \"scripts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"version-packages\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"changeset version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"release\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pnpm build &#x26;&#x26; changeset publish\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>changeset version</code> 执行时的具体操作：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>读取 <code>.changeset/</code> 下的变更文件</td>\n<td>收集所有待发布的变更</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>根据变更类型推断版本号</td>\n<td>major/minor/patch</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>更新 <code>package.json</code> 中的版本号</td>\n<td>每个受影响的包</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>更新内部依赖声明</td>\n<td><code>workspace:*</code> → 实际版本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>生成/更新 <code>CHANGELOG.md</code></td>\n<td>每个包的变更日志</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>删除已消费的 changeset 文件</td>\n<td>清理 <code>.changeset/</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"prepublishonly-脚本\">prepublishOnly 脚本</h2><p><code>prepublishOnly</code> 是 npm 生命周期中在 <code>npm publish</code> 执行前自动触发的脚本。在 Monorepo 中，它是确保发布前构建完成的安全网：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;@myorg/ui&quot;,&#10;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;2.1.0&quot;,&#10;  &quot;scripts&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;build&quot;: &quot;tsup&quot;,&#10;    &quot;prepublishOnly&quot;: &quot;pnpm run build&quot;,&#10;    &quot;postpublish&quot;: &quot;echo &#39;Published @myorg/ui@${npm_package_version}&#39;&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;files&quot;: [&quot;dist&quot;, &quot;README.md&quot;, &quot;CHANGELOG.md&quot;]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"@myorg/ui\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2.1.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"scripts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tsup\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"prepublishOnly\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pnpm run build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"postpublish\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"echo 'Published @myorg/ui@${npm_package_version}'\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"files\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dist\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"README.md\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CHANGELOG.md\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"npm-发布生命周期\">npm 发布生命周期</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[prepublishOnly] --&gt; B[prepare] --&gt; C[prepack] --&gt; D[pack 打包] --&gt; E[postpack] --&gt; F[publish 发布] --&gt; G[postpublish]\">flowchart LR\n    A[prepublishOnly] --&gt; B[prepare] --&gt; C[prepack] --&gt; D[pack 打包] --&gt; E[postpack] --&gt; F[publish 发布] --&gt; G[postpublish]</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>prepublishOnly</code> 只在 <code>npm publish</code> 时触发，不在 <code>npm install</code> 时触发。这是它与 <code>prepare</code> 脚本的关键区别。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"发布前验证\">发布前验证</h2><p>在实际发布到 npm 之前，应该执行一系列验证确保包的质量：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;scripts&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;prepublishOnly&quot;: &quot;pnpm run verify &amp;&amp; pnpm run build&quot;,&#10;    &quot;verify&quot;: &quot;pnpm run typecheck &amp;&amp; pnpm run test &amp;&amp; pnpm run lint&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"scripts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"prepublishOnly\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pnpm run verify &#x26;&#x26; pnpm run build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"verify\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pnpm run typecheck &#x26;&#x26; pnpm run test &#x26;&#x26; pnpm run lint\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 使用 publint 检查包的发布配置&#10;// npx publint packages/ui&#10;&#10;// 使用 arethetypeswrong 检查类型声明&#10;// npx @arethetypeswrong/cli packages/ui&#10;&#10;// 使用 npm pack --dry-run 预览将要发布的文件&#10;// npm pack --dry-run\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 使用 publint 检查包的发布配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// npx publint packages/ui</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 使用 arethetypeswrong 检查类型声明</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// npx @arethetypeswrong/cli packages/ui</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 使用 npm pack --dry-run 预览将要发布的文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// npm pack --dry-run</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>检查项</th>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>类型正确性</td>\n<td><code>@arethetypeswrong/cli</code></td>\n<td>检查 exports 和 types 是否匹配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>包配置</td>\n<td><code>publint</code></td>\n<td>检查 package.json 配置问题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>发布内容</td>\n<td><code>npm pack --dry-run</code></td>\n<td>预览将包含哪些文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>产物完整性</td>\n<td>自定义脚本</td>\n<td>检查 dist 目录是否存在</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"npm-provenance\">npm Provenance</h2><p><strong>npm Provenance</strong>（npm 来源证明）是 npm 的供应链安全特性，它将发布的包与 CI 构建链接起来，让消费方能验证包确实来自指定的源代码仓库和 CI 流水线：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# .github/workflows/release.yml&#10;jobs:&#10;  release:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    permissions:&#10;      contents: write&#10;      id-token: write&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;      - uses: pnpm/action-setup@v4&#10;      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          node-version: 20&#10;          registry-url: https://registry.npmjs.org&#10;&#10;      - run: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile&#10;&#10;      - name: Publish with provenance&#10;        run: pnpm changeset publish --provenance&#10;        env:&#10;          NODE_AUTH_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.NPM_TOKEN }}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># .github/workflows/release.yml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  release</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    permissions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      contents</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">write</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      id-token</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">write</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm/action-setup@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/setup-node@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          node-version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          registry-url</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">https://registry.npmjs.org</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm install --frozen-lockfile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Publish with provenance</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm changeset publish --provenance</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        env</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          NODE_AUTH_TOKEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ secrets.NPM_TOKEN }}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;scripts&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;release&quot;: &quot;changeset publish --provenance --access public&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;publishConfig&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;provenance&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;access&quot;: &quot;public&quot;,&#10;    &quot;registry&quot;: &quot;https://registry.npmjs.org&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"scripts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"release\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"changeset publish --provenance --access public\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"publishConfig\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"provenance\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"access\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"public\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"registry\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://registry.npmjs.org\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> npm provenance 需要 CI 环境（如 GitHub Actions）的 OIDC 支持。它在 npm 网站上会显示一个绿色的&quot;Provenance&quot; 徽章，证明包的来源可追溯。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"完整的自动化发布流水线\">完整的自动化发布流水线</h2><p>将以上所有步骤整合为一个完整的自动化发布流水线：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"name: Release&#10;on:&#10;  push:&#10;    branches: [main]&#10;&#10;concurrency:&#10;  group: release&#10;  cancel-in-progress: false&#10;&#10;jobs:&#10;  release:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    permissions:&#10;      contents: write&#10;      pull-requests: write&#10;      id-token: write&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          fetch-depth: 0&#10;&#10;      - uses: pnpm/action-setup@v4&#10;&#10;      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          node-version: 20&#10;          cache: pnpm&#10;          registry-url: https://registry.npmjs.org&#10;&#10;      - run: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile&#10;&#10;      - name: Build all packages&#10;        run: pnpm turbo run build&#10;&#10;      - name: Run tests&#10;        run: pnpm turbo run test&#10;&#10;      - name: Create Release PR or Publish&#10;        uses: changesets/action@v1&#10;        with:&#10;          version: pnpm changeset version&#10;          publish: pnpm changeset publish --provenance&#10;          commit: &#39;chore(release): version packages&#39;&#10;          title: &#39;chore(release): version packages&#39;&#10;        env:&#10;          GITHUB_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN }}&#10;          NODE_AUTH_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.NPM_TOKEN }}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Release</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    branches</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">concurrency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  group</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">release</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  cancel-in-progress</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  release</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\