le=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm changeset publish --provenance</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          commit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'chore(release): version packages'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          title</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'chore(release): version packages'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        env</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          GITHUB_TOKEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          NODE_AUTH_TOKEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ secrets.NPM_TOKEN }}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((发布工作流))&#10;    Changesets&#10;      changeset version&#10;      changeset publish&#10;      CHANGELOG 生成&#10;    生命周期&#10;      prepublishOnly&#10;      verify → build&#10;      postpublish&#10;    质量检查&#10;      publint&#10;      arethetypeswrong&#10;      npm pack dry-run&#10;    安全&#10;      npm provenance&#10;      OIDC 验证&#10;      供应链可追溯\">mindmap\n  root((发布工作流))\n    Changesets\n      changeset version\n      changeset publish\n      CHANGELOG 生成\n    生命周期\n      prepublishOnly\n      verify → build\n      postpublish\n    质量检查\n      publint\n      arethetypeswrong\n      npm pack dry-run\n    安全\n      npm provenance\n      OIDC 验证\n      供应链可追溯</pre><ul>\n<li>Changesets 提供了完整的版本更新和发布流程，自动处理多包间的版本依赖关系</li>\n<li><code>prepublishOnly</code> 脚本是发布前构建的安全网，确保产物始终是最新的</li>\n<li>发布前应使用 <code>publint</code> 和 <code>@arethetypeswrong/cli</code> 验证包配置和类型声明</li>\n<li>npm Provenance 将包与 CI 构建关联，提供供应链安全的可追溯性</li>\n<li>通过 GitHub Actions + Changesets Action 实现完全自动化的版本 PR 和发布流程</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"发布工作流","id":"发布工作流"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Monorepo 发布的复杂性","id":"monorepo-发布的复杂性"},{"level":2,"text":"Changesets Publish 流程","id":"changesets-publish-流程"},{"level":2,"text":"prepublishOnly 脚本","id":"prepublishonly-脚本"},{"level":3,"text":"npm 发布生命周期","id":"npm-发布生命周期"},{"level":2,"text":"发布前验证","id":"发布前验证"},{"level":2,"text":"npm Provenance","id":"npm-provenance"},{"level":2,"text":"完整的自动化发布流水线","id":"完整的自动化发布流水线"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"类型共享","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/shared-packages/type-sharing"},"next":{"title":"测试策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/testing-and-quality/testing-strategy"}}